{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nThe heat here in Prague is oppressive, a thick blanket that seems to press down upon the spirit. I spent this afternoon wandering the churches and galleries, seeking some coolness among the old paintings, yet the air remains heavy. It is a strange sensation, to be so far from our quiet Berlin evenings, walking alone through these crowded streets.\n\nI had the pleasure of lunching with my host’s family today. They are a cheerful lot, and after the meal, we drove out to a pleasure ground on the outskirts. The carriage ride was dusty, but the fresh air did me good. I dine with them again tomorrow, so do not worry for my sustenance, only for my patience. I miss your company and the comfort of our home. The journey is long, but I am making my way.\n\nYours,\nHegel"}}],"created":1795080472,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":177,"prompt_tokens":940,"total_tokens":1117,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-1V7VJLyyhZS0W0sqG9hmrnnSam4ejYlx","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":940,"prompt_ms":921.263,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.9800670212765957,"prompt_per_second":1020.3383832846864,"predicted_n":177,"predicted_ms":4257.501,"predicted_per_token_ms":24.19034659090909,"predicted_per_second":41.33880414825504}}